{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers","id":1220405,"title":"[Bestiary] The Thousand Sanctioned Beasts \u2014 Sorcerers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-19T19:57:55-07:00","id":1220405,"title":"[Bestiary] The Thousand Sanctioned Beasts \u2014 Sorcerers","content":"I return with a new entry in my bestiary, with ready-to-order stats for the ST in a hurry! The first entry was <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19vFKtpiQL6oTkvsURaLapD5MfRe45-iOfhapJOXl7IQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">martial artists</a>. The second entry was <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1g29aTtREJ-ZcXmJ1tmxTrO0FQDC-E4Jsepci0yGx6uQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">elementals</a>.<br /> <br /> Today, I'm bringing you a crop of <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G51UFrGh7Hko9JoQW1BndBEdAvQxRTWZ7ubDyfpQRC4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">sorcerers</a>! This entry includes four different types of magical fellow:<ul><li>the immortal, for magically-enhanced bodies (here's looking at you, Ysyr)</li> <li>the demonologist, for everybody who makes ichorous friends a key business strategy</li> <li>the necromancer, for soul-sucking assholes everywhere</li> <li>the exorcist, for hard-working sohei, Sijanese professionals, and everybody who helps you sleep at night and the dead sleep forever.</li> </ul>Because I knew you'd want them, I also included player-facing versions of all their spells. It's fun for the whole family, especially the parts who have demon flowers embedded in their torso and won't stop smiling!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T10:22:56-07:00","id":1220570,"title":"","content":"I like these, but Master\u2019s Call seems way too powerful.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m also not sure I \u201cget\u201d the Immortal. I mean, if they\u2019re supposed to be a front-line combatant, I would have expected more spells like Invulnerable Skin of Bronze or Wood Dragon\u2019s Claw that give them a nice long term boost and let them get to killing, instead of having a bunch of spells they\u2019ll need to spend multiple turns casting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 05-20-2018, 01:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T11:03:25-07:00","id":1220582,"title":"","content":"It definitely wouldn't hurt them to have either of those spells; I just felt vaguely obligated to provide new content. Adding something like that would be an excellent way to make them tougher (although you might need to reskin them a bit to match the aesthetic).<br /> <br /> Generally speaking, it's less that they're a front-line fighter and more that they don't <i>mind</i> being in the front line, so that they can mix it up and let their shaping ritual charge up motes for them every turn until they've got a spell ready.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T11:46:47-07:00","id":1220593,"title":"","content":"I'm unqualified as ever to comment on mechanics, but the spells have fantastic flavor. I'm a big fan of Star-Catcher's Word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T20:00:10-07:00","id":1220694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220570#post1220570\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like these, but Master\u2019s Call seems way too powerful.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I would never let a player have it, but as a one off to let a Mortal Sorcerer Overlord pose a serious challenge to the PCs, I definitely like it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T22:48:17-07:00","id":1220731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Steamfunk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220694#post1220694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would never let a player have it, but as a one off to let a Mortal Sorcerer Overlord pose a serious challenge to the PCs, I definitely like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its a simple action, but the effect its the same as the occult charm Spirit-Manifesting Word.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T03:34:06-07:00","id":1220777,"title":"","content":"Did we have a discussion thread for the Martial Artists? I can\u2019t find it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T08:02:05-07:00","id":1220837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220777#post1220777\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did we have a discussion thread for the Martial Artists? I can\u2019t find it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, but Rand's martial aritists can be found here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1177531-bestiary-a-collection-of-martial-artists\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...artial-artists</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T11:52:08-07:00","id":1220893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Steamfunk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220694#post1220694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would never let a player have it, but as a one off to let a Mortal Sorcerer Overlord pose a serious challenge to the PCs, I definitely like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, except for the spells, which I explicitly rewrote separate versions for players to use if they liked, I didn't bother balancing these against hypothetical versions for mortal players to buy with XP or consider their appropriateness as player-buyable mechanics. The demonologist can materialize demons for a WP because that's a useful ability for him to have if the ST accidentally rolls him into an encounter without any visible demons.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T12:59:47-07:00","id":1220910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sakii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220731#post1220731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Its a simple action, but the effect its the same as the occult charm Spirit-Manifesting Word.</div> </div> </div> </div>That really isn't a problem when it is on a QC that will be fighting 1 to 5 Solar Exalts. Balance is a contextual thing and what's fine for an NPC is not always fine for a PC. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rand Brittain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220893#post1220893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, except for the spells, which I explicitly rewrote separate versions for players to use if they liked, I didn't bother balancing these against hypothetical versions for mortal players to buy with XP or consider their appropriateness as player-buyable mechanics. The demonologist can materialize demons for a WP because that's a useful ability for him to have if the ST accidentally rolls him into an encounter without any visible demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's good stuff. I like all of your bestiaries. The martial artists in particular do a good job of creating more dangerous mortals for Exalt light games. Also, as far as reskins go, the martial arts techniques are a great way to build some quick, easy to manage, powerful monsters to stand in as tomb guardians, powerful ghost warriors, first circle demons, and the like. I don't know if you've read some of Sandact6's bestiary, but it also does a lot of interesting stuff where it throws out some of the corebook assumptions and tries to make antagonists that are interesting to fight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted is an aesthetic.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5526-steamfunk","name":"Steamfunk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5526_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T19:54:24-07:00","id":1221045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1220837#post1220837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> No, but Rand's martial aritists can be found here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1177531-bestiary-a-collection-of-martial-artists\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...artial-artists</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, excellent, thank you.<br /> <br /> I always wondered whether some of the QCs were Sidereal or Gentimian Exalted with the serial numbers filed off. Care to provide gentle enlightenment, Rand?<br /> <br /> Prototype00","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T23:12:19-07:00","id":1221086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1220405-bestiary-the-thousand-sanctioned-beasts-\u2014-sorcerers?p=1221045#post1221045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, excellent, thank you.<br /> <br /> I always wondered whether some of the QCs were Sidereal or Gentimian Exalted with the serial numbers filed off. Care to provide gentle enlightenment, Rand?<br /> <br /> Prototype00</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Considering that a couple of them popped up in <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/perturbation-in-palanquin\" target=\"_blank\">Rand's game</a>, using some of the iconic Sidereal tricks,I think it's a safe asumption that yes, that a &quot;Here's a secret Sidereal for your games to tide you over until we get around to that book&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T07:21:29-07:00","id":1221148,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the starry-eyed master is a Sidereal, and the yin-yang master is a Getimian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-31T07:27:03-07:00","id":1223613,"title":"","content":"Dear Rand Brittain, all your works are fantastic and I look forward to using them in my future games. Keep up the good work. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1131-hyper-prime","name":"Hyper Prime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1131_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}